# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CSP** allows ``unsafe-inline``/``unsafe-eval`` for ``script-src-elem`` and ``blob:`` workers/images, required by Penpot’s SPA and worker-based renderer."
msgstr "**CSP** permette ``unsafe-inline``/``unsafe-eval`` per ``script-src-elem`` e ``blob:`` lavoratori/immagini, richiesti da Penpot’s SPA e lavoratore-based renderr."

