msgid "**Reproducible installs:** every tool resolves to the pinned ``ref``, so the same commit installs the same linter version on every host and in every CI run."
msgstr "**Installazioni reproducibili:** ogni strumento si risolve al pinned ``ref``, così lo stesso commit installa la stessa versione linter su ogni host e in ogni run CI."

