msgid "**Reverse-Proxy/HTTPS Ready:** Preconfigured Atlassian Tomcat proxy envs so Jira respects external scheme/host/port."
msgstr "**Reverse-Proxy/HTTPS Pronti:** Preconfigurato Atlassian Tomcat proxy envs così Jira rispetti esterni scheme/host/port."

