# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Single key, per-app subdomains:** one hidden service serves every app at `<app>.<node>.onion`, Host-routed by OpenResty."
msgstr "**Singola chiave, per-app sottodomini:** un servizio nascosto serve ogni applicazione `<app>.<node>.onion`, Host-routed da OpenResty."

