# `docker *`♪ `gh api *`♪ `grep *`♪ `head *`♪ `tail *`♪ `tee *`♪ `wc *`♪ `echo
# *`♪ `pkill *`♪ `* > /tmp/*`♪ `*=* python* *`♪ `gh issue *`♪ `gh run *`♪
