msgid "From outside, every MCP path answers ``404``. The hub serves its route under two spellings — with and without the ``/index.php`` front controller — and ``roles/sys-svc-proxy/templates/mcp/vhost.conf.j2`` withdraws both, so neither reaches the Context Agent. ```files/playwright/test-mcp-guest.js`` <./files/playwright/test-mcp-guest.js>`__ probes all three public paths and asserts each answers ``>= 300`` without an MCP protocol body."
msgstr "Dall'esterno, ogni percorso MCP risponde ``404``. Il mozzo serve la sua rotta sotto due ortografia — con e senza il ``/index.php`` controller anteriore — e ``roles/sys-svc-proxy/templates/mcp/vhost.conf.j2`` ritira entrambi, quindi non raggiunge l'agente Contesto. ```files/playwright/test-mcp-guest.js`` <./files/playwright/test-mcp-guest.js>`__ probes all three public paths and asserts each answers ``>= 300`` senza un corpo di protocollo MCP."

