# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `pre-commit` hooks are installed automatically by `make environment-bootstrap`. Per-machine overrides go into the process environment before invoking `make` (e.g. `export INFINITO_FOO=…`); `make dotenv` honors caller-set values via setdefault semantics."
msgstr "The `pre-commit` ganci sono installati automaticamente da `make environment-bootstrap`. Per-macchina overrides andare in ambiente di processo prima di invocare `make` (ad esempio. `export INFINITO_FOO=…`); `make dotenv` onora i valori di caller-set tramite setdefault semantics."

