# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares no addons (it ships no ``meta/addons/`` directory). Mattermost **Team Edition** manages plugin install and enablement at runtime; there is no declarative per-plugin install path in this role. Plugins are operator-managed. The named volumes ``plugins`` and ``client-plugins`` declared in ``meta/volumes.yml`` are node-local derived copies that every replica extracts for itself from the image’s prepackaged bundles; an uploaded bundle persists in the file store, not in them. No addon bridges any in-repo service."
msgstr "Questo ruolo non dichiara addons (esso non spedisce ``meta/addons/`` directory). Mattermost **Edizione del Team** gestisce l'installazione e l'attivazione del plugin a runtime; non esiste un percorso di installazione per-plugin dichiarativo in questo ruolo. I plugin sono gestiti dall'operatore. I volumi nominati ``plugins`` e ``client-plugins`` dichiarato in ``meta/volumes.yml`` sono copie node-locale derivate che ogni replica si estrae dai fasci preconfezionati dell'immagine; un pacchetto caricato persiste nel file store, non in loro. Nessun addon collega qualsiasi servizio in-repo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares no addons (it ships no `meta/addons/` directory). Mattermost **Team Edition** manages plugin install and enablement at runtime; there is no declarative per-plugin install path in this role. Plugins are operator-managed. The named volumes `plugins` and `client-plugins` declared in `meta/volumes.yml` are node-local derived copies that every replica extracts for itself from the image's prepackaged bundles; an uploaded bundle persists in the file store, not in them. No addon bridges any in-repo service."
