msgid "This role deploys Fider as part of the Infinito.Nexus stack using a single Docker Compose container backed by PostgreSQL. It configures SSO via Keycloak automatically on first deploy, optional email notifications via Mailu, and HTTPS via NGINX reverse proxy."
