# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/01_setup.yml`](./tasks/01_setup.yml) seeds only the administrator into Magento's admin table (`bin/magento setup:install --admin-user`, credentials from [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)); `biber` reaches the backend solely through the oauth2-proxy declared in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml). In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that proxy is absent and `biber` has no native account, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. The `administrator` persona keeps its native login via `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` and runs in every variant."
msgstr "[`tasks/01_setup.yml`](./tasks/01_setup.yml) semi solo l'amministratore in Magento'La tabella di amministrazione (`bin/magento setup:install --admin-user`, credenziali da [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)); `biber` raggiunge il backend solo attraverso l'oauth2-proxy dichiarato in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml). Nel `services.sso.enabled: false` varianti matrice che proxy è assente e `biber` non ha un account nativo, quindi [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) rendering `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. `administrator` persona mantiene il suo login nativo tramite `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` e corre in ogni variante."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/05_administrator.yml`](./tasks/05_administrator.yml) creates the account with `tootctl accounts create` and never sets or captures a password, so `ADMIN_PASSWORD` — the Keycloak secret — cannot drive Mastodon's native `/auth/sign_in`; `biber` has no Mastodon account at all, since the OIDC sign-in ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) is the only path that would create one. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that path is removed, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The SeaweedFS companion scenario ([`files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js`](./files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js)) drives the same admin journey and skips on the same flag."
msgstr "[`tasks/05_administrator.yml`](./tasks/05_administrator.yml) crea l'account con `tootctl accounts create` e mai imposta o cattura una password, quindi `ADMIN_PASSWORD` — il Keycloak segreto — non può guidare Mastodon's nativo `/auth/sign_in`; `biber` no Mastodon conto a tutti, dal momento che il segnale OIDC ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) è l'unico percorso che ne creerebbe uno. Nel `services.sso.enabled: false` varianti matrice che il percorso viene rimosso, quindi [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) rendering `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` e `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. SeaweedFS scenario compagno ([`files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js`](./files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js)) guida lo stesso viaggio e salta sulla stessa bandiera."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml`](tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml) runs after `update.php`. It includes the shared gateway consumer contract, then reads both globals back out of the running container with `maintenance/run.php getConfiguration --format=json` and asserts the provider, the base URL and the model, so an unconfigured surface cannot reach a green deploy."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml`](tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml) corre dopo `update.php`. Include il contratto di consumo gateway condiviso, poi legge entrambi i globali fuori dal contenitore in esecuzione con `maintenance/run.php getConfiguration --format=json` e afferma il provider, l'URL di base e il modello, quindi una superficie non configurata non può raggiungere un dispiegamento verde."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) creates a dedicated non-superuser owner (`mcp@<canonical-domain>`, unusable password) plus its own workspace, and binds the endpoint to that pair."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) crea un proprietario non superiore dedicato (`mcp@<canonical-domain>`, password inutilizzabile) più il proprio spazio di lavoro, e lega il punto finale a quella coppia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) waits for the ExApp heartbeat, registers the deploy daemon and the ExApp (route `^/mcp`, verbs `POST,GET,DELETE`, access level `1`), enables the ExApp, mints an app password for the dedicated MCP account via `occ user:auth-tokens:add`, persists it through `sys-token-store` under `users['mcp-web-app-nextcloud'].tokens['web-app-nextcloud']`, and asserts that an authenticated `initialize` call answers `200`."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) aspetta il battito cardiaco ExApp, registra il demone di distribuzione e l'ExApp (itinerario `^/mcp`, verbi `POST,GET,DELETE`, livello di accesso `1`), abilita l'ExApp, minge una password app per l'account MCP dedicato tramite `occ user:auth-tokens:add`, persiste attraverso `sys-token-store` Articolo `users['mcp-web-app-nextcloud'].tokens['web-app-nextcloud']`, e afferma che un autenticato `initialize` risposte alle chiamate `200`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`templates/config.exs.j2`](./templates/config.exs.j2) wires Keycloak as the only login provider this role configures, and [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) creates no Mobilizon account; `MOBILIZON_INSTANCE_DISABLE_DATABASE_LOGIN` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) additionally closes the database login whenever LDAP is on. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants neither persona has credentials, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`templates/config.exs.j2`](./templates/config.exs.j2) fili Keycloak come unico fornitore di login questo ruolo configura, e [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) crea no Mobilizon account; `MOBILIZON_INSTANCE_DISABLE_DATABASE_LOGIN` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) chiude inoltre il login del database ogni volta che LDAP è attiva. Nel `services.sso.enabled: false` varianti matrix né persona ha credenziali, quindi [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) rendering `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` e `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. `guest` persona e le asserzioni di base corrono incondizionatamente."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) seeds only the administrator into SuiteCRM (`SUITECRM_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `SUITECRM_ADMIN_PASSWORD`); `biber` reaches the app through SuiteCRM's own SAML login against Keycloak, where `SAML_AUTO_CREATE` mints the account on first assertion. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants there is no SAML entry point and `biber` has no native account, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` for the generic persona journeys (the LDAP spec still signs `biber` in from the directory). The `administrator` persona keeps its native login via `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` and runs in every variant."
msgstr "[`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) semi solo l'amministratore in SuiteCRM (`SUITECRM_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `SUITECRM_ADMIN_PASSWORD`); `biber` raggiunge l'app attraverso SuiteCRM's proprio SAML login contro Keycloakdove? `SAML_AUTO_CREATE` mints il conto sulla prima affermazione. Nel `services.sso.enabled: false` varianti matrice non c'è punto di ingresso SAML e `biber` non ha un account nativo, quindi [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) rendering `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` per i viaggi generici di persona (il LDAP spec ancora segni `biber` nella directory). `administrator` persona mantiene il suo login nativo tramite `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` e corre in ogni variante."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in every matrix variant, because the shared persona helper cannot drive this role's sign-in in any of them. Three independent reasons, each sufficient on its own:"
msgstr "[`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) rendering `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` e `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in ogni variante di matrice, perché l'aiutante di persona condiviso non può guidare il segno di questo ruolo in nessuno di loro. Tre motivi indipendenti, ciascuno sufficiente per conto proprio:"

