msgid "`FusionDirectory <https://www.fusiondirectory.org/>`__ is a web-based LDAP administration tool that manages users, groups, and other directory objects through a pluggable interface. The application stores all of its data in an external LDAP directory, which makes it the natural front-end for the project’s ``svc-db-openldap`` backend."
