msgstr "`sys-front-inj-javascript` carichi `templates/javascript.js.j2` quando esiste e altrimenti rientra `files/javascript/javascript.js`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`sys-svc-compose` discovers the Dockerfile automatically by checking `templates/Dockerfile.j2` first and then `files/Dockerfile`. Both are rendered through the Ansible `template` module."
msgstr "`sys-svc-compose` scopre il Dockerfile automaticamente controllando `templates/Dockerfile.j2` prima e poi `files/Dockerfile`. Entrambi sono resi attraverso l'Ansible `template` modulo."

