# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's `mod_admin` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "Ejabberd's `mod_admin` HTTP UI è l'unica superficie testabile Playwright; il login client XMPP viene eseguito 5222/5269 e DEVE essere esercitato da un XMPP-consapevole cliente fuori dal loop di prova Playwright."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "l'unica superficie HTTP di ejabberd è `ejabberd_web_admin` su `/admin` (vedi [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). autentica un JID nudo contro LDAP su HTTP Basic, quindi non c'è Keycloak reindirizzare a seguire e nessun controllo di logout in-app per fare clic; l'autenticazione client stessa viene eseguita sulle porte 5222/5269 e rimane al di fuori del loop Playwright, come indicato sotto Punti di Orologio. `acl.admin` elenca inoltre solo l'amministratore JID, in modo che l'amministratore web rifiuta ogni altro account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) dichiara pertanto `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` e `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; `guest` persona e le affermazioni di raggiungibilità della linea di base sono incondizionate."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI è l'unica superficie testabile Playwright; il login client XMPP viene eseguito 5222/5269 e DEVE essere esercitato da un XMPP-consapevole cliente fuori dal loop di prova Playwright."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s only HTTP surface is ``ejabberd_web_admin`` on ``/admin`` (see ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "l'unica superficie HTTP di ejabberd è ``ejabberd_web_admin`` su ``/admin`` (vedi ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona e le affermazioni di raggiungibilità della linea di base sono incondizionate."

